Description:It is your first main phase. You control Hill Giant, enchanted by the opponent's Pacifism (it can't attack or block). You have Gods Willing (target creature you control gains protection from the color of your choice; scry 1) in hand with one white mana floating. The opponent is at 3 life and controls no creatures. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-protection-aura-falls-off | An Aura attached to a permanent with protection from its color is put into its owner's graveyard as a state-based action (CR 702.16c, 704.5m): give the Giant protection from white, Pacifism falls off, and the Giant attacks for 3; protection from any other color leaves it pacified
